/**
 * @component tree-browser
 * @selector .pfx-tree-browser
 * @summary A tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons.
 * @remarks Load the tree-browser interaction bundle for ARIA-tree keyboard navigation and expansion. Native `<details>` markup remains a CSS-only disclosure fallback; don't give that fallback ARIA-tree roles.
 * @modifier -icon-* — Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items.
 * @modifier -size-sm — Small.
 * @modifier -size-lg — Large.
 * @part .item — A leaf entry in the tree.
 * @pseudo ::before — Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open.
 * @cssstate open
 * @a11y Name the `role="tree"` root, use focusable `role="treeitem"` nodes, and associate each collection with its `role="group"` via `aria-owns`. Load `@pantoken/interactions/tree-browser.iife.js` for one tab stop and synchronized expansion. Add `aria-selected` to opt into single selection; focus alone doesn't select.
 * @example -canvas-rce -docs
 * ```html
 * <div class="pfx-tree-browser" role="tree" aria-label="Course files">
 *   <div role="none">
 *     <div role="treeitem" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-labelledby="course-tree-label" aria-owns="course-tree-group">
 *       <span class="item" id="course-tree-label"><span class="pfx-icon -icon-folder" aria-hidden="true"></span> Course files</span>
 *     </div>
 *     <div role="group" id="course-tree-group">
 *       <a class="item" role="treeitem" tabindex="-1" href="#syllabus">Syllabus.pdf</a>
 *       <div role="none">
 *         <div role="treeitem" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-labelledby="week-tree-label" aria-owns="week-tree-group">
 *           <span class="item" id="week-tree-label"><span class="pfx-icon -icon-folder" aria-hidden="true"></span> Week 1</span>
 *         </div>
 *         <div role="group" id="week-tree-group" hidden>
 *           <a class="item" role="treeitem" tabindex="-1" href="#reading">Reading.pdf</a>
 *           <a class="item" role="treeitem" tabindex="-1" href="#slides">Slides.pptx</a>
 *         </div>
 *       </div>
 *       <a class="item" role="treeitem" tabindex="-1" href="#rubric">Rubric.docx</a>
 *     </div>
 *   </div>
 * </div>
 * ```
 * @structure
 * .pfx-tree-browser {
 *   [role="none"] {
 *     [role="treeitem"] {
 *       .item {}
 *     }
 *     [role="group"]:optional {}
 *   }
 * }
 * @related menu — Both present nested, selectable entries.
