 `cleanup()` removes listeners/timers and restores the original marker and show class.

+For initialized tooltips, `-placement-*` is a preferred side, not a guarantee: the helper flips
+to the opposite side when there's more room and clamps the bubble into the viewport. Text wraps
+to a viewport-bounded width. Resize, scrolling, content changes, and direction changes update
+the position. Cleanup also restores the original positioning styles. Keep tooltips concise;
+long or interactive content belongs in a popover.
+
