+---
+"@pantoken/components": patch
+"@pantoken/interactions": patch
+"@pantoken/web-components": patch
+---
+
+Treat enhanced tooltip placements as preferences: flip to the opposite side when needed, clamp
+the bubble into view, and wrap text to the viewport width. Keep pointer bridges aligned with the
+effective side. Reposition on resize, scrolling, content, and direction changes, and restore
+authored positioning when the behavior is cleaned up.
*** End Patch

