/**
 * @component progress-circle
 * @selector .pfx-progress-circle
 * @summary A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties.
 * @remarks The ring is a `conic-gradient` donut painted on `::before` and clipped with a radial-gradient mask; `--value` divided by `--value-max` drives the arc. Add `-should-animate` and load the interactions entry point to animate it from zero on mount. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), spinning the ring at a fixed arc and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected.
 * @element progress, meter
 * @modifier -color-brand — Brand meter colour.
 * @modifier -color-info — Informational meter colour.
 * @modifier -color-success — Success meter colour.
 * @modifier -color-warning — Warning meter colour.
 * @modifier -color-danger — Danger meter colour.
 * @modifier -color-primary-inverse — On-dark (primary inverse) meter colour.
 * @modifier -size-xs — Extra small.
 * @modifier -size-sm — Small.
 * @modifier -size-md — Medium (default).
 * @modifier -size-lg — Large.
 * @modifier -should-animate — @interaction Animate the meter, ring, and centered value into place on mount.
 * @modifier -should-animate-on-mount — @alias {@link -should-animate}
 * @modifier -shold-animate-on-mount — @alias {@link -should-animate}
 * @modifier -meter-color-brand — @deprecated {@link -color-brand}
 * @modifier -meter-color-info — @deprecated {@link -color-info}
 * @modifier -meter-color-success — @deprecated {@link -color-success}
 * @modifier -meter-color-warning — @deprecated {@link -color-warning}
 * @modifier -meter-color-alert — @deprecated {@link -color-warning}
